config POSIX_ADVISORY_INFO
	bool "POSIX advisory information"
	help
	  Select 'y' here and Zephyr will provide implementations of the
	  _POSIX_ADVISORY_INFO Option: posix_fadvise(), posix_fallocate(),
	  posix_madvise(), and posix_memalign(). Access-pattern advice is
	  checked and kept for nothing, since no cache acts on it;
	  posix_fallocate() extends the file to cover the region.
